{{define "validate"}}
You are reviewing documents that AI agents read and act on. An agent can't ask the authors what they meant, so the docs have to say what only the authors know, and agree with themselves.

Report every place the docs fail one of these checks:

{{.Checklist}}

## How to report

- Report a problem only if it could lead an agent to act on something false, ambiguous or unexplained.
- Skip anything a capable reader can work out from the docs themselves or from general knowledge, and skip style, wording and formatting.
- Example code and sample data illustrate; don't review them as statements.
- Name the section, and quote the words at issue.
- If the docs pass every check, say so.

